   "note": "Read Nov 21, 2026 (published Nov 18, modified Nov 20). 39 operations numbered 1-39 in nine groups (Kingfishers 3, Kolts & Associates 5, M7 2, La Polilla Negra 2, Final Chapter 4, San4San 5, PTT Youngin$ 2, Guardia Brothers 3, Other Criminals 13). Ultimate Edition-only Illegal Goods Store (PTT Youngin$) not counted for 100% and not tracked in the Gangs menu. Yellow map icon once you enter; Map > Robberies (money bag) > Illegal Operations filter; unvisited shown as Robbery Opportunity; Progress > Gangs shows discovered/completed per gang; hover icon for key valuables (unique weapon variants, luxury watches, safe with cash), take all for completion; narcotics to fence; grayed out after, respawns after time. Gives no county/area per location, so none shown. Trusted source."
